{
 "title": "实践：银行账户",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "一个同时用到三种模式的例子：`deposit` 就地修改账户（`lend`），`close_and_transfer` 关闭账户并转交其资金（`consume`），而 `defer` 保证关闭消息一定输出。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "struct Account:",
    "    id: i32",
    "    balance: f64",
    "",
    "fn deposit(acc: lend Account, amount: f64):",
    "    acc.balance += amount",
    "",
    "fn close_and_transfer(acc: consume Account, target: lend Account):",
    "    defer print(\"Account\", acc.id, \"closed.\")",
    "    target.balance += acc.balance",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    mine = Account{ id: 101, balance: 500.0 }",
    "    savings = Account{ id: 202, balance: 1000.0 }",
    "    deposit(mine, 250.0)",
    "    print(\"after deposit:\", mine.balance)",
    "    close_and_transfer(mine, savings)",
    "    print(\"savings:\", savings.balance)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "after deposit: 750",
    "Account 101 closed.",
    "savings: 1750"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c05-l07-x1",
   "prompt": "编写 `withdraw(acc: lend Account, amount: f64)`：余额足够时扣除，否则什么也不做。从 100 的余额中先取 30，再取 90，并输出余额。",
   "starter": [
    "struct Account:",
    "    balance: f64",
    "",
    "fn withdraw(acc: lend Account, amount: f64):",
    "    pass",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    a = Account{ balance: 100.0 }",
    "    withdraw(a, 30.0)",
    "    withdraw(a, 90.0)",
    "    print(a.balance)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "struct Account:",
    "    balance: f64",
    "",
    "fn withdraw(acc: lend Account, amount: f64):",
    "    if acc.balance >= amount:",
    "        acc.balance -= amount",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    a = Account{ balance: 100.0 }",
    "    withdraw(a, 30.0)",
    "    withdraw(a, 90.0)",
    "    print(a.balance)"
   ],
   "hint": "如果 `acc.balance >= amount`，则 `acc.balance -= amount`。",
   "expected": [
    "70"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c05-l07-q1",
   "q": "关闭账户并转交其资金时，账户参数应使用哪种模式？",
   "options": [
    "`read`",
    "`lend`",
    "`consume`"
   ],
   "answer": 2,
   "why": "已关闭的账户不会再使用，所以接管所有权：`consume`。"
  }
 ]
}
